1.3.19 Debugging Questions

Debug these categories

314. Unexpected overridden method.


315. Wrong overloaded method.


316. Hidden field producing surprising output.


317. Static method hiding confusion.


318. Incorrect superclass constructor invocation.


319. Broken this() chain.


320. ClassCastException.


321. Incorrect inheritance relationship.


322. Mutable state leaking from an object.


323. Unexpected shared state between objects.


324. Incorrect interface default-method resolution.


325. Deep inheritance causing unexpected behavior.


326. Subclass violating superclass assumptions.



For every debugging problem:

Find → Explain → Fix → Explain why the bug happened → Prevent recurrence.


